@startuml
title P8 - Arquitectura GitOps y entrega progresiva

actor "Desarrollador" as Dev

rectangle "Repositorio principal" as Repo {
  artifact "Código + Helm" as Code
  artifact "Terraform" as TF
  artifact "Kyverno" as Policies
}

rectangle "GitHub Actions" as CI {
  artifact "Lint / Template" as Helm
  artifact "Trivy" as Trivy
  artifact "Build" as Build
  artifact "SBOM / Syft" as SBOM
  artifact "Cosign" as Cosign
  artifact "k6" as K6
}

database "Container Registry" as Registry
database "Repositorio GitOps" as GitOps
rectangle "Argo CD" as Argo

rectangle "Kubernetes / sa-p8" as K8s {
  component "Kyverno" as Kyverno
  component "Sealed Secrets" as Sealed
  component "Argo Rollouts" as Rollouts
  component "Gateway Stable" as Stable
  component "Gateway Canary" as Canary
  component "Microservicios" as Services
  component "PostgreSQL / RabbitMQ" as Data
}

Dev --> Code
Code --> Helm
Code --> Build
TF --> K8s
Policies --> Kyverno
Helm --> Trivy
Build --> Registry
Build --> SBOM
Build --> Cosign
Trivy --> K6
K6 --> GitOps
GitOps --> Argo
Argo --> K8s
Argo --> Rollouts
Rollouts --> Stable
Rollouts --> Canary
Rollouts --> Services
Services --> Data
Sealed --> K8s

note right of Rollouts
Canary:
20% -> Analysis
50% -> Analysis
80% -> Analysis
100%

Analysis fallido:
Abortar + mantener estable
end note

@enduml